sequenceDiagram
    participant Provider as Market Data Provider
    participant API as ASP.NET Core API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant React as React Dashboard

    loop Near-live polling / streaming
        Provider-->>API: New market candle/tick
        API->>API: Validate + normalise data
        API->>DB: Store/update market data
        DB-->>API: Stored
        API-->>React: Market update
        React->>React: Update chart and latest price
    end
